================================================================================
Apache License, Version 2.0 (January 2004) — full text
================================================================================

The full text of the Apache License, Version 2.0, is identified
canonically by the SPDX identifier `Apache-2.0` and is reproduced at:

    https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.txt
    https://spdx.org/licenses/Apache-2.0.html

For licensing tooling and SBOM generators that require the full
license text on disk, run the helper:

    scripts/fetch-license-texts.sh

which downloads the canonical Apache-2.0 and MIT text from the
SPDX archive into LICENSE-APACHE-2.0.txt and LICENSE-MIT.txt
respectively. The downloaded files are gitignored to keep the
working tree small; CI provisions them automatically on cargo
package / SBOM generation.

